list: user.command_surfacer_commands
-
prose overlay: open buffered dictation editor with hat editing
chuck <hat>: delete a word by its hat letter
chuck past <hat>: delete from start through hat word
speak: read prose overlay buffer aloud via TTS
mouse clock: activate clock-face mouse overlay
what commands: show a random voice command reminder
next command: cycle to next command in surfacer
hide commands: dismiss the command surfacer panel
ticket: open ticket management overlay
recall <name>: jump to a saved window by name
cancel recall: cancel in-flight phrase
